text = "Records show the victim traveled from Asterfall and was employed as a tailor before taking the overnight cleaning assignment. Detectives are examining cleaning equipment, staff logs, and witness accounts. No suspect has been named, and the motive remains unknown.

Edition printed before the afternoon service departed."

